  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Relevant/inspired threads: \nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/better-focus-on-events\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/in-game-event-pass-to-access-event-instances-and-schedule\nSponsored events are happening in VRChat quite more frequently than in the past. Some will see it on the World tab and not have a good understanding of the sponsored event being shown, or be confused of its premise or features.\nI've noticed some events are paid via third-party websites albeit approved by VRChat, but because users might have their payment options linked to their VRChat account via Steam/Oculus with VRChat Plus subscription, I would enjoy the idea of being able to purchase tickets from within VRChat and have my accessibility to applicable areas on my account, or via a per account basis whether it's a public event like VKet, or a private event like Furality.\nI would also enjoy it if I could take a look at upcoming events on VRChat's website and get a quick summary or goals of these events to enjoy them up more. If also possible, be able to view events ahead of time with the Launch Pad menu. I've noticed it was done for some events, but not for others and it doesn't seem to be consistent or standardized.",
